%N A397970 Number of inequivalent ways to place 4 nonattacking kings on an n X n board, with equivalence being up to rotations.
%H A397970 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A397970/b397970.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
